1
00:00:00,111 --> 00:00:02,941
(Penny:)Uh, denial. See, sweetie,
the list goes on and on.

2
00:00:02,947 --> 00:00:04,477
(Leonard:)That's just crazy.

3
00:00:04,482 --> 00:00:06,582
(Leonard:)How would my going in there
even help you?

4
00:00:06,584 --> 00:00:08,884
(Penny:)I don't know. You could talk to
her, and maybe if it comes up,

5
00:00:08,886 --> 00:00:10,286
(Penny:)you could ask if she's heard
about the drug.

6
00:00:10,288 --> 00:00:11,518
(Leonard:)What if I get caught?

7
00:00:11,522 --> 00:00:12,952
Fear of failure!
Lack of confidence!

8
00:00:12,957 --> 00:00:14,857
Kind of a wuss!

9
00:00:16,327 --> 00:00:17,527
(Leonard:)Fine, I'll do it.

10
00:00:17,528 --> 00:00:20,058
(Leonard:)But not because of them,
because I love you.

11
00:00:20,064 --> 00:00:20,794
(Penny:)Thank you.

12
00:00:20,798 --> 00:00:21,998
(Raj:)Pushover.
Spineless.

13
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:22,900
(Sheldon:)Still hasn't bought milk

14
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:24,830
(Sheldon:)even though I told him
two days ago!

15
00:00:29,741 --> 00:00:31,711
(Howard:)That was incredible.

16
00:00:31,709 --> 00:00:33,209
(Bernadette:)It was.

17
00:00:33,211 --> 00:00:35,211
(Bernadette:)I just wish Stuart
wasn't around

18
00:00:35,213 --> 00:00:37,283
(Bernadette:)so we didn't have
to be so quiet.

19
00:00:37,282 --> 00:00:38,712
(Sheldon:)I know.

20
00:00:38,716 --> 00:00:40,446
(Howard:)It's not like
he returns the favor

21
00:00:40,451 --> 00:00:43,951
(Howard:)when he watches
his Japanese porn cartoons.

22
00:00:45,123 --> 00:00:47,023
(knocking)
STUART: You guys got a minute,

23
00:00:47,025 --> 00:00:48,595
(Stuart(knocking):)or are you
still cuddling?

24
00:00:48,593 --> 00:00:50,023
(mouthing)

25
00:00:50,028 --> 00:00:51,558
(Howard:)What is it, Stuart?

26
00:00:51,562 --> 00:00:53,232
STUART:
Can I come in?

27
00:00:53,231 --> 00:00:54,531
(Howard:)Hang on.

28
00:00:54,532 --> 00:00:56,562
(quietly):
Should I send him away?

29
00:00:56,567 --> 00:00:57,797
(Bernadette:)No, it's okay.

30
00:00:57,802 --> 00:01:02,022
STUART:
Thanks, Bernie.

